Qi Zhi.

585
00:24:20,160 --> 00:24:21,790
I heard your current company

586
00:24:22,070 --> 00:24:23,720
is doing really well, right?

587
00:24:24,110 --> 00:24:25,640
E-commerce is booming lately, right?

588
00:24:25,640 --> 00:24:26,590
So my freight company

589
00:24:26,590 --> 00:24:27,480
is benefiting from it.

590
00:24:27,480 --> 00:24:29,000
I'm planning to open
another freight company

591
00:24:29,000 --> 00:24:30,400
here in Qingwu.

592
00:24:30,510 --> 00:24:31,190
Really?

593
00:24:32,110 --> 00:24:34,310
Qi Zhi has really made it.

594
00:24:34,810 --> 00:24:35,960
His business keeps expanding.

595
00:24:35,960 --> 00:24:37,510
The Qi family's ancestors must be

596
00:24:37,510 --> 00:24:38,750
blessing him!

597
00:24:39,450 --> 00:24:40,780
Come on, don't say that.

598
00:24:40,790 --> 00:24:42,240
I work from dawn to dusk every day,

599
00:24:42,240 --> 00:24:44,970
and you're giving all the credit
to my ancestors?

600
00:24:45,240 --> 00:24:46,350
My son is capable

601
00:24:46,590 --> 00:24:48,720
and has brought honor to the Qi family.

602
00:24:48,880 --> 00:24:49,480
If any of you are

603
00:24:49,480 --> 00:24:50,640
looking for a job in the future,

604
00:24:50,640 --> 00:24:51,320
just go to him.

605
00:24:51,320 --> 00:24:53,750
The pay is definitely
better than at the mine.

606
00:24:53,750 --> 00:24:54,480
Really?

607
00:24:55,030 --> 00:24:56,200
Stop bragging.

608
00:24:56,590 --> 00:24:57,510
You make it sound like

609
00:24:57,510 --> 00:24:58,550
we own a mine.

610
00:25:00,070 --> 00:25:01,350
Let me propose a toast to everyone.

611
00:25:01,350 --> 00:25:03,200
-Come on, cheers.
-Cheers.

612
00:25:03,640 --> 00:25:04,110
Cheers.

613
00:25:04,720 --> 00:25:05,780
Congratulations.

614
00:25:08,370 --> 00:25:10,300
I was just trying to support my son.

615
00:25:12,140 --> 00:25:12,830
Honey.

616
00:25:14,480 --> 00:25:16,010
How about we move back, too?

617
00:25:16,590 --> 00:25:17,720
Look at all the neighbors.

618
00:25:17,720 --> 00:25:19,720
It's so lively when we're together.

619
00:25:21,110 --> 00:25:21,570
Cao Xin,

620
00:25:22,020 --> 00:25:23,160
are you seeing anyone?

621
00:25:23,160 --> 00:25:23,730
How about

622
00:25:24,640 --> 00:25:25,750
I set you up with someone?

623
00:25:25,750 --> 00:25:26,080
Yeah.

624
00:25:27,110 --> 00:25:27,570
No need.

625
00:25:28,110 --> 00:25:28,570
No need.

626
00:25:29,160 --> 00:25:31,110
My uncle is already into someone.

627
00:25:31,880 --> 00:25:32,270
For real?

628
00:25:32,270 --> 00:25:33,470
What did you just say?

629
00:25:33,920 --> 00:25:35,270
Here, have a chicken drumstick

630
00:25:35,270 --> 00:25:36,270
and stop talking.

631
00:25:37,310 --> 00:25:38,700
Here, have one more, one more.

632
00:25:38,700 --> 00:25:39,550
That's not right.

633
00:25:39,550 --> 00:25:40,070
You should bring

634
00:25:40,070 --> 00:25:41,480
the one you like back for us to meet.

635
00:25:41,480 --> 00:25:42,240
Mom, mom, mom.

636
00:25:42,240 --> 00:25:44,440
Stop being so gossipy.

637
00:25:44,870 --> 00:25:45,510
I-I'm just concerned...

638
00:25:45,510 --> 00:25:46,550
Instead of worrying about others,

639
00:25:46,550 --> 00:25:48,020
worry about me, your own son,

640
00:25:48,020 --> 00:25:49,000
and find me a girlfriend.

641
00:25:49,000 --> 00:25:49,400
Cheers.

642
00:25:49,400 --> 00:25:49,860
Cheers.

643
00:25:56,160 --> 00:25:57,090
Director Zhang.

644
00:25:59,240 --> 00:26:00,370
For all these years,

645
00:26:00,440 --> 00:26:01,240
there's been

646
00:26:01,720 --> 00:26:03,450
something weighing on my mind.

647
00:26:04,070 --> 00:26:04,600
Go ahead.

648
00:26:07,240 --> 00:26:08,000
Tell me...

649
00:26:10,440 --> 00:26:12,390
Director Zhang, tell me,

650
00:26:12,550 --> 00:26:14,410
how was my performance at the mine

651
00:26:14,960 --> 00:26:16,070
back then?

652
00:26:16,350 --> 00:26:17,010
It was good.

653
00:26:17,310 --> 00:26:18,040
Good, right?

654
00:26:18,160 --> 00:26:18,550
Yep.

655
00:26:19,550 --> 00:26:22,030
I had been an advanced worker
for so many years,

656
00:26:22,030 --> 00:26:22,430
right?

657
00:26:22,590 --> 00:26:23,050
Indeed.

658
00:26:23,590 --> 00:26:24,650
You were the leader

659
00:26:25,550 --> 00:26:26,440
in charge of HR.

660
00:26:29,240 --> 00:26:29,720
I...

661
00:26:34,240 --> 00:26:35,680
I just don't get it.

662
00:26:37,310 --> 00:26:39,880
How could you just listen to

663
00:26:40,750 --> 00:26:42,350
a few words from Cao Dongfang

664
00:26:42,640 --> 00:26:43,930
and lay off a...

665
00:26:44,480 --> 00:26:46,680
a veteran miner

666
00:26:47,110 --> 00:26:48,440
like me,

667
00:26:48,440 --> 00:26:49,850
an excellent veteran miner

668
00:26:49,850 --> 00:26:51,480
who once won medals?

669
00:26:53,400 --> 00:26:53,960
Aihua,

670
00:26:54,240 --> 00:26:54,680
let me tell you...

671
00:26:54,680 --> 00:26:55,740
I just don't get it.

672
00:26:56,510 --> 00:26:58,750
You've got a huge misunderstanding.

673
00:26:59,270 --> 00:26:59,870
Back then,

674
00:27:00,420 --> 00:27:02,210
the layoff list was decided

675
00:27:02,240 --> 00:27:03,200
by the director.

676
00:27:03,960 --> 00:27:05,420
Besides, you were laid off

677
00:27:06,750 --> 00:27:08,030
not because Cao Dongfang played dirty

678
00:27:08,030 --> 00:27:09,030
behind your back.

679
00:27:09,310 --> 00:27:10,440
He even went to the director's office

680
00:27:10,440 --> 00:27:11,500
to speak up for you.

681
00:27:11,920 --> 00:27:12,350
Aihua,

682
00:27:13,510 --> 00:27:14,160
I'm sorry.

683
00:27:14,980 --> 00:27:16,000
I was the one who submitted

684
00:27:16,000 --> 00:27:17,200
that list back then.

685
00:27:17,230 --> 00:27:18,890
If I had spoken up for you a bit,

686
00:27:19,160 --> 00:27:20,160
maybe...

687
00:27:21,200 --> 00:27:22,060
How about this?

688
00:27:22,680 --> 00:27:23,610
I'll down 3 shots

689
00:27:24,030 --> 00:27:25,510
to apologize to you,

690
00:27:26,070 --> 00:27:26,440
okay?

691
00:27:31,600 --> 00:27:32,660
-Come on.
-Come on.

692
00:27:34,350 --> 00:27:35,030
Nice wine.

693
00:27:35,270 --> 00:27:35,680
Eat up.

694
00:27:36,350 --> 00:27:37,210
Take your time.

695
00:28:02,790 --> 00:28:03,390
Dongfang.

696
00:28:10,270 --> 00:28:10,930
Go ahead...

697
00:28:10,930 --> 00:28:11,530
Dongfang.

698
00:28:17,960 --> 00:28:19,160
You've been wronged.

699
00:28:20,960 --> 00:28:21,560
Dongfang,

700
00:28:23,510 --> 00:28:25,000
I feel bad for you.

701
00:28:27,350 --> 00:28:28,310
I wronged you.

702
00:28:29,440 --> 00:28:30,170
Dongfang...

703
00:28:31,830 --> 00:28:32,430
I'm sorry.

704
00:28:32,960 --> 00:28:33,350
Okay.

705
00:28:34,110 --> 00:28:35,170
Alright, alright,

706
00:28:35,270 --> 00:28:36,130
this is enough.

707
00:28:37,720 --> 00:28:39,310
I'm the one who was wronged.

708
00:28:39,640 --> 00:28:41,030
Why are you crying?

709
00:28:48,480 --> 00:28:50,340
I couldn't tell right from wrong.

710
00:28:50,880 --> 00:28:52,440
I was so heartless!

711
00:28:58,070 --> 00:28:59,330
Aihua, that's enough.

712
00:28:59,480 --> 00:29:00,440
Stop crying.

713
00:29:01,070 --> 00:29:03,070
Don't let the kids see you like this.

714
00:29:03,070 --> 00:29:03,530
Come on.

715
00:29:04,790 --> 00:29:05,250
Come on.

716
00:29:06,510 --> 00:29:07,240
Let's drink.

717
00:29:08,960 --> 00:29:09,960
Alright, cheers.

718
00:29:10,510 --> 00:29:10,970
Cheers.

719
00:29:13,400 --> 00:29:14,000
Dongfang,

720
00:29:15,480 --> 00:29:16,080
I'm sorry.

721
00:29:18,790 --> 00:29:19,590
My apologies.

722
00:29:34,880 --> 00:29:35,610
I'm so sorry.

723
00:29:37,680 --> 00:29:38,110
Okay.

724
00:29:38,880 --> 00:29:39,410
Alright.

725
00:29:39,590 --> 00:29:40,600
It's okay

726
00:29:41,160 --> 00:29:42,220
since you're here.

727
00:29:55,400 --> 00:29:56,000
Qinglian,

728
00:29:56,550 --> 00:29:57,590
is Aihua okay?

729
00:29:58,110 --> 00:29:59,430
He's always like that when he's drunk.

730
00:29:59,430 --> 00:30:00,360
Just ignore him.

731
00:30:02,920 --> 00:30:03,450
Lingzhi.

732
00:30:04,370 --> 00:30:05,800
Your son, Zihao,

733
00:30:05,830 --> 00:30:07,590
has made his mark.

734
00:30:08,070 --> 00:30:09,350
I heard he won

735
00:30:09,370 --> 00:30:11,770
a world championship playing video games.

736
00:30:12,440 --> 00:30:13,450
The world

737
00:30:13,480 --> 00:30:14,960
is changing so fast.

738
00:30:14,960 --> 00:30:16,440
Are we all getting old?

739
00:30:17,550 --> 00:30:18,080
Alright,

740
00:30:18,310 --> 00:30:20,750
you can just benefit
from your son's success from now on.

741
00:30:20,750 --> 00:30:21,080
Okay.

742
00:30:22,590 --> 00:30:23,120
Let's go.

743
00:30:23,440 --> 00:30:24,500
What success can I benefit from?

744
00:30:24,500 --> 00:30:25,110
He doesn't even

745
00:30:25,110 --> 00:30:26,310
have a girlfriend yet,

746
00:30:26,310 --> 00:30:27,550
unlike your two kids,

747
00:30:27,830 --> 00:30:29,360
who are both big bosses now.

748
00:30:29,750 --> 00:30:30,920
I heard their son, Qi Zhi,

749
00:30:30,920 --> 00:30:31,990
hooked up with Cao Si

750
00:30:31,990 --> 00:30:33,440
right after he got out of prison,

751
00:30:33,440 --> 00:30:34,480
and they were having an affair.

752
00:30:34,480 --> 00:30:35,410
Did you see them flirting

753
00:30:35,410 --> 00:30:36,610
at the table just now?

754
00:30:36,920 --> 00:30:37,920
No wonder Director Zhou's son

755
00:30:37,920 --> 00:30:38,720
divorced her.

756
00:30:38,960 --> 00:30:39,750
What man could tolerate

757
00:30:39,750 --> 00:30:40,920
such a thing?

758
00:30:41,070 --> 00:30:42,070
Exactly.

759
00:30:43,110 --> 00:30:44,700
Aren't you afraid of karma for gossiping

760
00:30:44,700 --> 00:30:46,030
behind people's backs?

761
00:30:46,240 --> 00:30:46,840
Qinglian.

762
00:30:46,960 --> 00:30:47,920
We're all neighbors!

763
00:30:47,920 --> 00:30:49,290
Everyone knows
each other's skeletons in the closet!

764
00:30:49,290 --> 00:30:50,320
Don't make me

765
00:30:50,350 --> 00:30:51,480
spill all your dirty secrets

766
00:30:51,480 --> 00:30:52,880
for everyone to laugh at!

767
00:30:52,960 --> 00:30:54,080
Qinglian, calm down.

768
00:30:54,080 --> 00:30:55,000
What were you two talking about?

769
00:30:55,000 --> 00:30:55,930
Stop gossiping.

770
00:30:56,070 --> 00:30:57,350
What does it have to do with you?

771
00:30:57,350 --> 00:30:57,920
Go away.

772
00:30:58,510 --> 00:30:59,160
Do you

773
00:30:59,350 --> 00:31:00,810
have nothing better to do?

774
00:31:03,240 --> 00:31:03,840
Qinglian,

775
00:31:04,160 --> 00:31:04,890
don't be mad.

776
00:31:05,350 --> 00:31:06,880
Don't stoop to their level.

777
00:31:12,510 --> 00:31:13,200
Qinglian,

778
00:31:14,070 --> 00:31:14,830
I heard that

779
00:31:16,000 --> 00:31:18,000
Cao Si married
into the Zhou family back then

780
00:31:18,000 --> 00:31:19,260
just to get that letter

781
00:31:19,260 --> 00:31:20,720
of forgiveness for Qi Zhi.

782
00:31:22,740 --> 00:31:24,670
Well, Qi Zhi's life was ruined.

783
00:31:25,220 --> 00:31:27,000
But... But didn't Cao Si have her life

784
00:31:27,000 --> 00:31:28,130
ruined as well?

785
00:31:30,750 --> 00:31:32,640
You care so much about these two kids.

786
00:31:32,640 --> 00:31:33,370
Why don't you

787
00:31:33,720 --> 00:31:35,180
allow them to be together?

788
00:31:35,550 --> 00:31:36,200
Right?

789
00:31:59,270 --> 00:32:00,070
You made them?

790
00:32:01,270 --> 00:32:02,190
Not bad.

791
00:32:02,240 --> 00:32:04,700
They're so pretty.
Who did you make them for?

792
00:32:05,070 --> 00:32:06,800
Who do you think I made them for?

793
00:32:07,830 --> 00:32:10,290
Who was crying and begging
to marry someone?

794
00:32:12,160 --> 00:32:12,590
Mom,

795
00:32:13,060 --> 00:32:14,030
you agree to let me and Cao Si

796
00:32:14,030 --> 00:32:14,760
be together?

797
00:33:24,320 --> 00:33:25,180
Is this enough?

798
00:33:28,830 --> 00:33:29,560
Thanks, Mom.

799
00:33:29,790 --> 00:33:30,480
Save it.

800
00:33:33,880 --> 00:33:34,720
Thanks, Mom!

801
00:33:34,970 --> 00:33:37,690
You're the best mother in the world!

802
00:33:37,880 --> 00:33:39,200
Put me down.

803
00:33:39,930 --> 00:33:41,280
You silly boy.

804
00:33:49,510 --> 00:33:50,000
Doudou,

805
00:33:50,750 --> 00:33:52,110
can you tell Grandpa

806
00:33:52,350 --> 00:33:54,030
who your uncle

807
00:33:54,310 --> 00:33:54,920
likes?

808
00:33:55,440 --> 00:33:56,350
Yes, of course.

809
00:33:56,370 --> 00:33:57,650
But Grandpa,

810
00:33:57,680 --> 00:34:00,110
can you help me

811
00:34:00,130 --> 00:34:02,590
with the math problems
my uncle assigned me?

812
00:34:03,510 --> 00:34:04,550
Sure, no problem.

813
00:34:04,550 --> 00:34:06,240
And 5 pages of tracing.

814
00:34:06,400 --> 00:34:07,400
That's fine, too.

815
00:34:07,640 --> 00:34:08,480
Then tell Grandpa

816
00:34:08,480 --> 00:34:09,010
who it is.

817
00:34:09,570 --> 00:34:12,380
The girl my uncle likes is...

818
00:34:12,400 --> 00:34:13,139
Doudou,

819
00:34:13,440 --> 00:34:14,500
what are you doing?

820
00:34:15,000 --> 00:34:15,760
Have you finished

821
00:34:15,760 --> 00:34:16,630
the homework I gave you?

822
00:34:16,630 --> 00:34:17,670
Not yet.

823
00:34:17,840 --> 00:34:19,699
"Not yet"? Then hurry up and do it.

824
00:34:20,400 --> 00:34:21,870
Don't scare the kid.

825
00:34:22,030 --> 00:34:22,360
Go on.

826
00:34:23,670 --> 00:34:24,190
Dad,

827
00:34:25,440 --> 00:34:27,230
you can't keep spoiling him like this.

828
00:34:27,230 --> 00:34:28,530
I'm not spoiling him.

829
00:34:29,310 --> 00:34:30,239
He's just a kid.

830
00:34:30,320 --> 00:34:31,190
Can he finish

831
00:34:31,190 --> 00:34:32,250
all that homework?

832
00:34:32,429 --> 00:34:32,800
Dad,

833
00:34:33,540 --> 00:34:34,929
when I was Doudou's age,

834
00:34:34,960 --> 00:34:35,590
you gave me

835
00:34:35,590 --> 00:34:36,650
way more homework.

836
00:34:37,110 --> 00:34:38,560
You and he

837
00:34:38,590 --> 00:34:39,449
are different.

838
00:34:43,480 --> 00:34:45,280
I dote on my grandchild. So what?

839
00:34:48,330 --> 00:34:50,659
Dad is getting more and more like Grandpa.

840
00:34:52,070 --> 00:34:53,110
Thanks to you,

841
00:34:54,000 --> 00:34:55,659
it feels like our two families

842
00:34:56,000 --> 00:34:57,730
are back to the way we used to be.

843
00:34:58,150 --> 00:34:58,680
How nice.

844
00:35:12,750 --> 00:35:14,110
What brand is your dress?

845
00:35:14,110 --> 00:35:15,120
It's so stylish

846
00:35:15,150 --> 00:35:16,070
with unique buttons.

847
00:35:16,070 --> 00:35:16,880
Prime Era.

848
00:35:17,030 --> 00:35:17,960
Haven't you heard of it?

849
00:35:17,960 --> 00:35:19,820
This brand is really popular now.

850
00:35:20,480 --> 00:35:22,130
I heard there's a meteor shower tonight.

851
00:35:22,130 --> 00:35:23,660
Let's go watch it together?

852
00:35:24,400 --> 00:35:25,510
No. Are you serious?

853
00:35:25,510 --> 00:35:27,710
We've still got a lot to do at the office.

854
00:35:28,550 --> 00:35:31,590
I've already booked tickets
for the observation deck.

855
00:35:31,590 --> 00:35:33,050
They're quite expensive.

856
00:35:35,430 --> 00:35:36,190
I have an appointment

857
00:35:36,190 --> 00:35:37,840
with Mr. Zhang tonight
to discuss business.

858
00:35:37,840 --> 00:35:39,670
What tickets? Are they refundable?

859
00:35:39,670 --> 00:35:40,710
Go return them.

860
00:35:41,150 --> 00:35:41,610
Well...

861
00:35:43,710 --> 00:35:44,670
Which Mr. Zhang?

862
00:35:45,110 --> 00:35:46,030
In the midsummer

863
00:35:46,030 --> 00:35:46,880
of 2010,

864
00:35:47,230 --> 00:35:49,760
the Lyrid meteor shower
arrived as expected,

865
00:35:49,800 --> 00:35:51,630
ready to paint the night sky

866
00:35:51,710 --> 00:35:53,240
with a fabulous spectacle.

867
00:35:53,800 --> 00:35:55,310
At 23:00 on the 22nd,

868
00:35:55,550 --> 00:35:56,710
the Lyrid meteor shower

869
00:35:56,710 --> 00:35:58,570
will reach its peak viewing time.

870
00:35:58,920 --> 00:35:59,400
By then,

871
00:35:59,670 --> 00:36:00,510
countless meteors,

872
00:36:00,510 --> 00:36:02,110
like blooming fireworks,

873
00:36:02,400 --> 00:36:04,590
will light up the night sky
in a dazzling way

874
00:36:04,590 --> 00:36:05,410
and present

875
00:36:05,440 --> 00:36:07,100
a breathtaking visual feast.

876
00:36:10,070 --> 00:36:11,800
Waiting this long to see stars

877
00:36:11,960 --> 00:36:13,150
isn't romantic at all.

878
00:36:13,150 --> 00:36:14,600
